      "GmdIndex" : 23,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You seem to have gotten quite\r\naccustomed to this forest.\r\nYou've passed the challenge.\r\nI think it's time for you to have an\r\nelven bow— a magick bow.",
        "Jp" : "君、だいぶこの森に慣れてきたみたいね\r\n課題は合格よ\r\nそろそろ君にもエルフの弓――\r\n魔道弓を持ってもらおうかな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 190515,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Elven archers were known as 'Element Archers.'\r\nTheir archery differed from that of hunters, as\r\nthey fired life force as their arrows.",
        "Jp" : "エルフの弓師は《エレメントアーチャ―》\r\nと呼ばれていたの\r\n生命力を矢として放つ\r\nハンターのとは異なる弓術よ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 190516,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If you join me as an Elemental Archer, and seek\r\nout the mysterious techniques left behind by the\r\nelves, I'll feel much more confident.",
        "Jp" : "君が私と一緒に、エレメントアーチャ―として\r\nエルフが遺した神秘の技を探求して\r\nくれるなら、私も心強いわ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 190517,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 26,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Let's reclaim their techniques together.",
        "Jp" : "彼らの技、私達で取り戻しましょう"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 190518,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
